  "body": "### Summary\n`PostingSession.send(since:)` and `FencedSend` are now the shared fence of every write (poll vote, #412; MP thread delete, #451), but they live in `Polls/PollVoteFlow.swift`. Move them to `Posting/` so the next write flow finds them where it looks, with no behaviour change.\n\n### Scope\n- Move `FencedSend` and the `send(since:)` extension from `Packages/HFRKit/Sources/HFRClient/Polls/PollVoteFlow.swift` to a file under `Packages/HFRKit/Sources/HFRClient/Posting/` (for example `PostingSession+Fence.swift`).\n- No API or behaviour change, and no test change beyond imports or paths. The full `swift test` stays green.\n- Update the doc comments or spec lines that point at the old file (LOT-054, LOT-094 and #448 mentions).\n\n### Source\n- Fable's finding 3 on #451 (LOT-094 follow-up, merged as 6dc9126).\n- Operator request, 2026-11-03.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] `rg 'send\\(since:' Packages/HFRKit/Sources` finds the definition under `Posting/`.\n- [ ] CI is green, and Opus reviews it (Sonnet work).\n- [ ] The PR says `Closes #N`.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
